  "details": "Pic and video related.\n\nIt seems Face Mirror rely on occlusion culling which causes annoying and disturbing flickering around closed areas.\n\nI assume it is uses MirrorReflection layer, and this layer not unique only for player's avatar, so other unwanted world objects might appear if culling is off. \n\nHowever, bounds of the camera is pretty small, and depth might be reduced by reasonable distance, so other unwanted MirrorReflection will not be visible anyways.",
